WEBVTT

s1-course-layout
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:13.450
Riley's nine-hole course at Lakeside is laid out hole by hole — each one named, with Red and Blue basket positions carrying their own distances in feet. One course, two ways to play it.

s2-single-round
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:27.540
Not every event needs two rounds. Club Night plays this course as a single round at the Red positions — one round on the schedule, and no intermission in sight.

s3-two-rounds
00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:45.470
The FLI demonstration event plays the same nine physical holes twice: Round 1 at Red, an intermission break, then Round 2 at Blue — eighteen holes of play on a nine-hole course.

s4-groups
00:00:49.300 --> 00:01:02.440
Six groups are staffed for the event. Group 1 pairs two teams and their four rostered athletes, with Casey assigned as the scorekeeper — assignments made now, so Phase 1G scoring can pick them up.
